# Files in this repo that are NOT part of the published site.
# Same role as the 404 redirects the Netlify projects used: the deploy
# directory is the repo root, so anything not listed here would be served.
# There is no wrangler.toml to list any more: this site is static files only,
# and the config that enabled a Workers copy of it (a second hostname nothing
# pointed at) was deleted with that deployment.
tools/
# The Pages Function that serves /api/medium. Pages compiles functions/ from the
# repository at deploy time — the same directory — so its source is never part of
# the upload, and an ignored file cannot be served as a static file under
# /functions/. Same rule the other sites in this collection use.
functions/
README.md
CLAUDE.md
LICENSE
.gitignore
_headers
.git/
.github/
.freebuff/
# Build output of `node tools/deploy-pages.mjs`: the staged upload, which is what
# the Pages build publishes.
.pages-bundle/
.pages-dist/
